# Public build-time configuration for `vite build` (loaded automatically in
# production mode). The WalletConnect (Reown) project id is a public client
# identifier — it ships in the bundle regardless — so it is committed here to
# keep the https://console.keel.codes build reproducible.
#
# Everything else stays optional; see .env.example for the full list.
